# Files that must not be uploaded to the Vercel deployment.
#
# Everything in this repo is served publicly at app.cardinalroster.com unless
# listed here. Verified 2026-07-29 by requesting each path against production —
# all of the entries below returned HTTP 200 to an anonymous visitor.
#
# NOT ignored, deliberately: docs/ (the contract PDFs are referenced 6x by the
# app as print masters), every image asset (all referenced), bulk_assign.html
# (referenced 2x), api/ (serverless functions).

# --- Development context. Not referenced by any shipped code. ---
# .claude/ contains the build skill: BUG_CLASSES.md, OPEN_ITEMS.md, HANDOFF.md,
# cardinal_build_log.md, gates.md. Known bugs and unfinished work should not be
# a public document.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.github/

# --- Reference notes. Written for Theo, not for the app. Zero references from
#     index.html; nothing fetches it. It carries vendor pricing, our read on
#     it, and notes on how we work — none of which belongs on a customer-facing
#     domain. ---
AI_CHEATSHEET.md

# --- Orphaned scratch pages. Zero references from index.html; each was
#     returning 200 in production. ---
adjuster directory.html
cardinal truth fixes.html
claims_form_fixes.html
convert_client_type.html
insurance hub bridge.html
community_hub.html
community_partners.html
community_client_view.html
community_portal_theme.html
community_stages.html

# --- Company letterhead. Not referenced by the app; it is a Word template Theo
#     writes letters in. A blank letterhead is the raw material for forged
#     correspondence, so it should not be a public download. ---
brand/

# --- SQL. CLAUDE.md's standing convention is "SQL ships as separate .sql
#     files", and there was no rule here for them — the first migration
#     committed would have been served at app.cardinalroster.com. Migrations
#     are run against Supabase by hand; they are never fetched by the app. ---
*.sql

# --- ai-field-manual.html DELIBERATELY SHIPS. The Resource Library iframes it
#     (build 562), so it has to be served — an ignored file 404s the section.
#     Checked before the decision: no credentials, no client records, no staff
#     addresses. What a stranger with the URL learns is that Cardinal has
#     60,485 CompanyCam photos and a three-row claims table. Theo was shown
#     that and chose the served file over inlining 248 KB into index.html.
#     It carries <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">. ---

# --- Operational tooling for the DGX Spark. Runs on Theo's own hardware,
#     never fetched by the app. Nothing here should be on a public domain. ---
spark/

# supplement.html DELIBERATELY SHIPS (build 668) — the Supplement Desk,
# the studio.html pattern: served publicly, gated by its own Supabase
# sign-in + an is_cardinal_admin() check, and api/supplement.js enforces
# admin server-side. supplement_desk.sql is covered by the *.sql blanket.
